WEBVTT

00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:30.203
there was no separation of sexes.

00:00:30.689 --> 00:00:33.976
In other words, men and women
were worshiping all together.

00:00:34.825 --> 00:00:39.603
They were together while doing tawāf,
the circular walk around the Kaaba.

00:00:39.627 --> 00:00:41.220
They were together while praying.

00:00:41.244 --> 00:00:44.802
And if you wonder
why this is interesting at all,

00:00:44.826 --> 00:00:47.407
you have to see the rest of Saudi Arabia,

00:00:47.431 --> 00:00:51.976
because this a country which is strictly
divided between the sexes.

00:00:52.588 --> 00:00:53.754
In other words:

00:00:53.778 --> 00:00:57.521
as men, you are simply not supposed to be
in the same physical space

00:00:57.545 --> 00:00:58.709
with women.

00:00:58.733 --> 00:01:00.619
And I noticed this in a very funny way.